   "sourceHash": "5fcc1ff036c2b8b59c1d7f39bff42e880f16bb7580afe087979a93f143af60e0",
   "text": "チェックイン、チェックアウトおよび滞在に関する方針",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0d9e8398054cc05f95ee",
   "sourceHash": "0d9e8398054cc05f95ee5f5653393bd3caef4d99885785f1e6fa2173f21f73ef",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]チェックイン時間：[[CLOSE_1]]12:00 PM（正午）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Time kept as 12:00 PM with 正午 (noon) added to avoid the Japanese 午後12時 ambiguity."
   ]
  },
  {
